From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: glacier <hyouga.dev@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 15:05:13 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Drop the unused JDBC drivers and trove; fastutil in their
 place

mysql-connector-java 5.1.14 and sqlite-jdbc 3.7.2 (both from 2010) are
removed: the server never loads them and the plugins it runs ship their own
relocated MariaDB driver. Only a plugin using Bukkit's ebean database would
need one, and none does.

trove4j 3.0.3 is replaced by fastutil, already on the classpath, in
DataWatcher, World/WorldServer (chunkTickList), Chunk.entityCount,
ChunkCreatureCensus, SpawnerCreature, CaseInsensitiveMap, SpigotConfig,
AntiXray and CraftMetaItem, keeping trove's answers for absent keys.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

